Z||000030||GarethWright||03-27-2001||02:49 AM||||I hate the way it looks so Cool,<BR>I hate the way it takes turns so flat,<BR>I hate the way that v6 roars,<BR>I hate not having seats in the back!<P>O' for a Pickup Truck,<BR>O' For an SUV!<BR>Please, ANYTHING for a Minivan,<BR>Just get this car away from me!<P>It's too much fun for any one man,<BR>It's way too low to the ground,<BR>It's my number one hated car of all time,<BR>It's too bad it wasn't made in Japan!<P>Wait, what on earth am I saying?<BR>Oh my, what the heck have I done?<BR>Where do you think YOU are going?<BR>Don't you know its all just in Fun?<P>Keep those Fiero's going,<BR>Keep those complaints to yourself,<BR>The other guy don't know what He's missing,<BR>HE can get parts of the shelf!<P>So when some moron asks you where its from,<BR>Just smile and knowingly say,<BR>"What are you, some kind of Idiot?<BR>This was born in the U.S of A!"<P>-Gareth (yea, I wrote that myself  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)||||reg||1
