Z||000054||kslish||03-27-2001||08:40 PM||||I happen to like the interior for its "uniqueness."  However, I think they could have designed a small locking glovebox in place of the "map pocket/holder whatever" (type depends on the year) that the passenger side of the dash contains.  <P>I "hate" the steering wheel wobble my GT has, the scratching of the side windows that occurs if your dew wipes get too old, the fact that the automatic transmissioned Fieros don't have a fourth gear for overdrive, and so on....probably some other stuff I can't think of right now.  <P>However, most of these things can be fixed with little time and $$$  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ken S.<BR>'87 GT and '86 SC<BR> <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A> ||||reg||1
