Z||000061||rogergarrison||03-28-2001||06:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fyerstarter:<BR><B>Amen Darklord. The interior on these things is the worst! I don't think I have ever seen an uglier interior in any car. I can't imagine what kind of drugs the designers were on when they decided to put a cheap interior such as this in such an exoticly styled car such as the GT. No offense to you coupe owners but this interior would fit that car, but not in mine. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Have you seen some of the interiors of some european exotics. My Mercedes door panels were just flat and square leather with a pickup truck style armrest. Ferrari F-40's dont even have an interior, just seat covers and bare aluminum everywhere, no carpet, and just a wire in the door for an inside handle.<BR>||||reg||1
