Z||000066||Master_Sushi||03-28-2001||10:06 PM||||I love the dash and interior in my fiero. It matches the exotic look of the car very well. It reminds me of being in the cockpit of a plane when driving  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. Its also very functional, everything is laid out quite well and in reach. Its allot better then most newer GM dashes I’ve seen, all the trim matches up with no gaps. I also like the hex screws holding all the trim in, reminds me of a Ferrari. Oh and I cant possibly see how my coupe looks "boxy"?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||4
