Z||000072||pontiacs4me||03-29-2001||04:13 AM||||I hate that my brake light wont turn off unless I put my left heel on the ebrake handle while I drive.  But today I pulled back the black ebrake boot and messed around inside, the light turned off.  It stayed off until I got my right pant bottom caught on the handle and pulled up on it, while I was getting out.  Oh yeah thats another thing I hate.  <BR>I hate the rear wheel gap, and the fact that the rear springs are so big, that you cant fit all that fat of a rear tire on there, without some 700 dollar coilovers.  <BR>I hate that damn exhaust leak, I hate when the guys at the auto parts store call me a sucker when I tell them I have a fiero, I hate that the front parking lights are so far in there, (to be fixed by next week, secret flushmount in progress) I hate that I spent hours building a custom subwoofer box for the front trunk and I can hardly feel it inside the car, I hate that they had two types of side trim, actually I hate the side trim.  I hate that gt front bumpers are just big enough that when boxed up and ready to ship UPS wont take it.  I hate the blue noise box, thats why I killed it.  I hate it when my friend Andy that is 6'8" gets out he hits his knees on that dash dash area that sticks out. I hate the design of the guage cluster area that sticks out from the rest of the dash pad, the rest of the dash is ok.  I hate the curling console pieces syndrome.  other than that stuff, the car is awesome and I love it.||||reg||1
